{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"150729","name":"Boutique Hotel Anahi","description":"Hotel has reception open 24/7 . This stylish and exclusive hotel enjoys a prime setting just a stone's throw from the Piazza del Popolo and a short walk from the Villa Medici, Villa Borghese and Spanish Steps. The Vatican and Castel Sant'Angelo are within walking distance, while the Coliseum and Roman Forum are only a short metro ride away. Set in an elegantly refurbished former house, the hotel provides an intimate atmosphere with 16 comfortable guest rooms, all soundproofed, air-conditioned and en suite, furnished with wooden floors and tasteful décor. Each room provides complimentary toiletries and wireless internet access, and guests might take advantage of the hotel's helpful services such as assistance in arranging sightseeing tours, all for a marvellous stay in the Eternal City.","address":"Via Della Penna, 65","city":"ROMA","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00186","lat":41.909473,"lng":12.474723,"stars":3,"giataCode":"248518","phone":"063216011","email":"INFO@HOTELANAHI.COM","website":"www.hotelanahi.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/150729/150729a_hb_ro_039.jpg","roomCode":"APT.C4","category":"room","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/150729/150729a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/150729/150729a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/150729/150729a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/150729/150729a_hb_a_008.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/150729/150729a_hb_a_009.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/150729/150729a_hb_a_010.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/b